# Phase 4.1 — Seed Real DonutSMP Auction GUI

We now have real screenshots and manually confirmed DonutSMP GUI information.

Do not redesign the project.

Update the discovery/GUI model using these confirmed facts, but do not hardcode unknown slot indices from screenshots.

## Confirmed real GUI

Auction GUI title format:

```text
Auction (Page 1)
Auction (Page 2)
...
```

Recognize with a pattern equivalent to:

```regex
^Auction \(Page (\d+)\)$
```

Semantic state:

```text
AUCTION_PAGE
```

Extract the page number from the title.

