## Changed-Slot Detection

On `AUCTION_PAGE`, the refresh workflow should eventually be:

```text
known AUCTION_PAGE
→ identify validated REFRESH control
→ click REFRESH
→ receive GUI/slot updates
→ compare previous and current auction snapshots
→ process only changed/new listing slots
```

A refresh click must be guarded by:

```text
correct GUI title/signature
correct semantic button
correct item identity
known slot from live discovery
```

Never click an anvil merely because an anvil exists somewhere in an unknown GUI.

